=comment Package: Gtk4, C-Source: stringlist
use v6.d;

#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#--[Class Description]----------------------------------------------------------
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

=begin rakudoc
=TITLE Gnome::Gtk4::StringObject
=head1 Description

B<Gnome::Gtk4::StringObject> is the type of items in a L<Gnome::Gtk4::StringList|/content-docs/api2/reference/Gtk4/StringList>.

A B<Gnome::Gtk4::StringObject> is a wrapper around a C<Str>; it has a I<string> property that can be used for property bindings and expressions.

